#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
