#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
