#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
