msgid "Honestly, I don't trust it."
msgstr "Ehrlich gesagt, traue ich ihm nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED"
msgid "Good. Let her ferry our supplies around."
msgstr "Gut. Lass ihn unsere Vorräte herumkutschieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING"
msgid "Good. Let her ferry our supplies around."
msgstr "Gut. Lass ihn unsere Vorräte herumkutschieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC"
msgid "Good. Let her ferry our supplies around."
msgstr "Gut. Lass ihn unsere Vorräte herumkutschieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF"
msgid "It's useless out here without power."
msgstr "Ohne Strom bringt das hier draußen nichts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I don't see it."
msgstr "Ich werde so tun, als würde ich es nicht sehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. What a pity."
msgstr "Ach, wie schade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Not bad, for a parlour trick."
msgstr "Nicht übel für einen Taschenspielertrick."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF"
msgid "It's useless out here without power."
msgstr "Ohne Strom bringt das hier draußen nichts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "How disappointingly rustic."
msgstr "Enttäuschend bodenständig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Who cares?"
msgstr "Wen kümmert's?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Not the most useful invention, is it?"
msgstr "Nicht die hilfreichste Erfindung, oder?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "I prefer my fuel more nightmarish."
msgstr "Ich ziehe Brennstoff in Albtraumversion vor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "I do wish it would hurry up."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, es ginge schneller."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "What's it cooking up now?"
msgstr "Ist es ausgekocht?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "Finally!"
msgstr "Endlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Something about it... ah, I'm sure it's nothing."
msgstr "Etwas daran ... ach, es ist bestimmt nichts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "Stop looking at me, cookie fiend."
msgstr "Starr mich nicht an, du dummer Keks."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "We're celebrating freezing to death, I see."
msgstr "Verstehe, wir feiern, dass wir zu Tode frieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "I don't even use a cane."
msgstr "Ich brauch keinen Stock."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "It is unbound from time."
msgstr "Nicht an die Zeit gebunden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "How, err... traditional."
msgstr "Ach, wie ... traditionell."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "It's extremely rich."
msgstr "Das ist verdammt gut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Glorified apple juice."
msgstr "Ein besserer Apfelsaft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "Such a decadent beverage."
msgstr "Was für ein dekadentes Getränk."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "My... favorite... she remembered."
msgstr "Das hab ich am liebsten ... dass sie sich daran erinnert hat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Gaudy, like the rest of this shindig."
msgstr "Kitschig, wie der Rest von diesem Rummel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "What a thing to risk one's life for."
msgstr "Was für eine Sache, für die man das Leben riskieren würde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "A volatile decoration."
msgstr "Eine flüchtige Dekoration."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "There's something familiar about this..."
msgstr "Das kommt mir irgendwie bekannt vor ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "How frivolous."
msgstr "Wie frivol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL"
msgid "That old crab does have some skill."
msgstr "Die alte Krabbe hat doch einiges drauf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's a Winter's Feast miracle."
msgstr "Ein Winterfest-Wunder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "That's that, it seems."
msgstr "Ich glaub, das war's."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "How wretchedly jolly."
msgstr "Wie fürchterlich nett."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "Have we nothing better to do with our time?"
msgstr "Haben wir nichts Besseres zu tun?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "That's that, it seems."
msgstr "Ich glaub, das war's."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "How repulsively festive."
msgstr "Wie widerlich festlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "What manner of creature lives in there?"
msgstr "Was für eine Kreatur lebt denn da drinnen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
msgid "They didn't look like that when I was in charge."
msgstr "So sahen die aber nicht aus, als ich zuständig war."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "I'd prefer it without the sharp, pinching claws."
msgstr "Ich ziehe ihn ohne seine scharfen Scheren vor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr "Ausgezeichnet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "I forgot my bib."
msgstr "Ich hab mein Lätzchen vergessen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "I'd rather not get hair all over my suit."
msgstr "Ich möchte keine Haare an den Anzug kriegen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "I'd rather not get hair all over my suit."
msgstr "Ich möchte keine Haare an den Anzug kriegen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "She slobbers..."
msgstr "Sie sabbert ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "She slobbers..."
msgstr "Sie sabbert ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT"
msgid "I thought I saw Wilson munching on one."
msgstr "Ich dachte, ich hätte Wilson gesehen, wie er auf einem herumkaut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "The strongman %s seems a little unhinged."
msgstr "Der starke %s scheint ein wenig aus den Angeln gehoben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Did you intend to burn that, %s?"
msgstr "Wolltest du das verbrennen, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day to you, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Guten Tag, Herr %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "Let's find a heart. I'll prepare my incantations."
msgstr "Lass uns ein Herz suchen. Ich bereite schon mal meine Beschwörungen vor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderous fiend! Behold my power!"
msgstr "Mörderischer Unhold! Siehe meine Macht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "%s tethers lost spirits to this world."
msgstr "%s ruft verlorene Geister in diese Welt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE"
msgid "Ah yes. What could be more motivating than the shriek of a whistle?"
msgstr "Ah, ja. Was könnte mehr motivieren als das Kreischen einer Pfeife?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER"
msgid "That ape is a menace."
msgstr "Dieser Affe ist eine Plage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Who allowed the ape to play with fire?!"
msgstr "Wer hat dem Affen erlaubt, mit Feuer zu spielen?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "What are you looking at, ape?"
msgstr "Was schaust du denn so, Affe?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "What a shame."
msgstr "Was für eine Schande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "It's high time I put that creature down."
msgstr "Allerhöchste Zeit, dass ich diese Kreatur umlege."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "At least the ape appears to be well trained."
msgstr "Wenigstens scheint der Affe gut trainiert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "Too rugged for my tastes."
msgstr "Zu zerlumpt für meinen Geschmack."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is going against the grain..."
msgstr "%s geht gegen den Strich ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "Ha! What a delightful curse."
msgstr "Ha, was für ein netter Fluch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "Yew don't look so wood."
msgstr "Siehst etwas holzig aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Is it wise to start fires, given your predilections?"
msgstr "Ist es klug, mit deinen Vorlieben Feuer machen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, Herr %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "That blockhead could use a heart."
msgstr "Der Sturkopf könnte ein Herz vertragen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Not the most dignified form you've taken."
msgstr "Nicht die würdevollste Form, die du je angenommen hast."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "It seems you've run a-fowl of something, pal."
msgstr "Mir sträuben sich die Federn, Kumpel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "Wonderful. A screw-loose moose."
msgstr "Wunderbar. Ein Elch zum Knutschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "I'll leave you to you moose-ings while I seek out a heart."
msgstr "Ich möchte dich in deinen Elchbelangen nicht stören."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Fiend! Time to make like a tree...!"
msgstr "Unhold! Schlag hier keine Wurzeln, verschwinde!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s seems very in touch with the spirits of the forest."
msgstr "%s scheint mit den Geistern des Waldes sehr in Berührung."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT"
msgid "Better that way."
msgstr "So ist es besser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm appalled by the idea of sitting for some reason."
msgstr "Die Vorstellung zu sitzen, stößt mich seltsamerweise ab."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Good. You sit. Forever."
msgstr "Gut. Setz dich. Für immer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT"
msgid "It didn't go with the decor anyway."
msgstr "Er hat eh nicht zur Deko gepasst."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone should really set this table."
msgstr "Irgendjemand sollte wirklich diesen Tisch decken."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Someone should really set this table."
msgstr "Irgendjemand sollte wirklich diesen Tisch decken."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Something stirs."
msgstr "Da rührt sich etwas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "You aren't fooling me, plant."
msgstr "Du legst mich nicht herein, Pflanze."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "I didn't make that one! Honest!"
msgstr "Der ist nicht von mir! Ehrlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's worse knowing what the other part looks like."
msgstr "Es ist schlimmer zu wissen, wie die andere Seite aussieht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "I assure you that it smells worse than it looks."
msgstr "Ich kann dir versichern, dass es schlechter riecht, als es aussieht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "It looks ill."
msgstr "Sieht krank aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "What a neat trick."
msgstr "Netter Trick."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "This one isn't very good."
msgstr "Das hier ist nicht sehr gut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "You aren't fooling me, plant."
msgstr "Du legst mich nicht herein, Pflanze."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER"
msgid "It's time you make like a tree and leaf."
msgstr "Zeit, dass du eine Baumlänge Abstand hältst."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s has been starting fires, now hasn't he?"
msgstr "%s hat doch Feuer gelegt, oder nicht?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, Herr %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST"
msgid "What a shame. Now I'll never know what that gem does."
msgstr "Wie schade. Jetzt werde ich nie erfahren, was der Edelstein macht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER"
msgid "Don't worry, %s. I'll make it a clear cut."
msgstr "Keine Sorge, %s. Ich mache einen klaren Schnitt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER"
msgid "I suppose he has his uses."
msgstr "Er wird wohl seinen Nutzen haben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "Disgusting."
msgstr "Widerlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "That carrot is revolting!"
msgstr "Diese Karotte ist abstoßend!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "You thought you could fool me?"
msgstr "Du dachtest, du kannst mich reinlegen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "I'm sure it is diseased."
msgstr "Sie ist bestimmt verblichen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "They aren't very sociable."
msgstr "Nicht gerade umgänglich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "I bet it's delicious."
msgstr "Bestimmt köstlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep is only a temporary escape."
msgstr "Schlaf ist nur eine kurze Flucht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Finally, a mutation that's actually useful."
msgstr "Endlich mal eine nützliche Mutation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS"
msgid "Who unearthed this monstrosity?"
msgstr "Wer hat diese Ungeheuerlichkeit ausgegraben?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "Do not make me bind you with magic, imp."
msgstr "Wenn du nicht aufhörst, werde ich dich mit einem Zauber fesseln müssen, Kobold."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Do I smell fire and brimstone?"
msgstr "Rieche ich Feuer und Schwefel?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mr. %s."
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, Herr %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Serves you right, meddling imp."
msgstr "Geschieht dir recht, wenn du dich einmischst."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Enough is enough! Prepare to be banished, imp!"
msgstr "Genug ist genug! Dir wird bald ein Ende gesetzt, Kobold!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Hm. I'll allow you to stay on this plane awhile longer."
msgstr "Hm. Ich werde dir erlauben, noch eine Weile hier zu bleiben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG"
msgid "I knew that imp couldn't be trusted."
msgstr "Ich wusste, dass man diesem Kobold nicht trauen kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER"
msgid "Is that his fur? Grotesque."
msgstr "Ist das Fell? Grotesk."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR"
msgid "He's a soul sucker, that one."
msgstr "Dieser Kerl ist ein Seelensauger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
msgid "This is no time for childishness!"
msgstr "Das ist nicht die Zeit für Kindereien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Who left the tiny green demon unsupervised?!"
msgstr "Wer hat den kleinen grünen Dämon unbeaufsichtigt gelassen?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Miss %s."
msgstr "Oh hallo, Fräulein %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "Oh dear, whatever will become of your kingdom now?"
msgstr "Meine Güte, was soll nun aus deinem Königreich werden?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER"
msgid "%s has revealed her true nature!"
msgstr "%s hat ihr wahres Gesicht gezeigt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER"
msgid "Ah, thank you, %s."
msgstr "Ah, vielen Dank, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR"
msgid "Stop mucking about with that lunar filth!"
msgstr "Hör auf, mit diesem Mondschmutz herumzualbern!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW"
msgid "How heartwarming to see today's youth take an interest in shadow magic."
msgstr "Wie herzerwärmend es ist, zu sehen, dass die Jugend sich für Schattenmagie interessiert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "If you're going to attack, at least finish the job!"
msgstr "Wenn du schon angreifst, dann führ die Sache auch bis zum Ende durch!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Mx. %s is making good on their promises of mayhem."
msgstr "Meister %s sorgt endlich für das versprochene Chaos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, Mx. %s."
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "A shame about your death. You were the only one I half-liked."
msgstr "Schade, dass du tot bist. Du warst der einzige, den ich wenigstens ein bisschen mochte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderous fiend! This will be your destruction!"
msgstr "Mörderischer Unhold! Dies wird dein Ende sein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "%s never did respect human mortality."
msgstr "%s hat die Sterblichkeit des Menschen noch nie respektiert."

