#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
