msgstr "König der Bullen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "He won't bully us any more."
msgstr "Er wird uns nicht mehr tyrannisieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "I never knew we could be friends!"
msgstr "Ich hätte nicht gedacht, dass wir Freunde sein könnten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Aw, you're no fun."
msgstr "Ah, du bist nicht lustig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "They look angry."
msgstr "Die sehen böse aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "He's all furry now!"
msgstr "Er ist jetzt ganz pelzig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Aww... that's too bad."
msgstr "Ach, wie schade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "We should find some meat for it."
msgstr "Wir sollten etwas Fleisch dafür finden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "We can make some fun stuff now!"
msgstr "Jetzt können wir tolle Dinge machen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Take that!"
msgstr "Nimm das!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "Little pig, little pig, let me in!"
msgstr "Liebes, gutes kleines Schwein, lass mich doch zu dir hinein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "If only we could get closer."
msgstr "Wenn wir nur näher kommen könnten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "Wow! We have our very own pig friend!"
msgstr "Toll, jetzt haben wir unseren eigenen Schweinefreund!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "Neat! The Pig King would like that."
msgstr "Nett! Dem Schweinekönig würde das gefallen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "It's bursting with life."
msgstr "Platzt vor Leben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Grow, grow!"
msgstr "Wachsen, wachsen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "It's a pirate flag!"
msgstr "Das ist eine Piratenflagge!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "We found the treasure!"
msgstr "Wir haben einen Schatz gefunden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "A good tool to play in the dirt."
msgstr "Ein gutes Werkzeug, um im Dreck zu spielen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "It's all squishy."
msgstr "Das ist alles matschig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It smells kind of rotten."
msgstr "Riecht irgendwie verrottet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "It's teaching us so much about plants!"
msgstr "Dadurch lernen wir so viel über Pflanzen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "What will blossom?"
msgstr "Was wird erblühen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Is it done yet?"
msgstr "Schon fertig?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "We grew it together!"
msgstr "Das haben wir gemeinsam gezogen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's all dried out and dead."
msgstr "Sie ist komplett ausgetrocknet und tot."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "What a funny play!"
msgstr "So eine lustige Aufführung!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH"
msgid "Does it have a happy ending?"
msgstr "Hat es ein glückliches Ende?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT"
msgid "It's so heavy!"
msgstr "Sie ist so ... schwer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "It's not scary. We won't cover our eyes."
msgstr "Es ist nicht gruselig. Wir schauen nicht weg."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s looks mean."
msgstr "%s sieht gemein aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s, you lit a fire!"
msgstr "%s, du hast ein Feuer gemacht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey! Hi %s!"
msgstr "Hey! Hi %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry, %s, we'll find you a heart!"
msgstr "Keine Sorge, %s, wir finden ein Herz für dich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Meanie! Get'em!"
msgstr "Fiesling! Auf ihn!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is super nice to ghosts."
msgstr "%s weiß, wie man mit Geistern umgeht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Remember us?"
msgstr "Erinnerst du dich an uns?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
msgid "Gonna be our own best friend!"
msgstr "Wir werden unser eigener bester Freund sein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD"
msgid "Is this the one we lost?"
msgstr "Ist das die Karte, die wir verloren haben?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER"
msgid "Can we play with your tools, Ms. Wanda? We'll be careful!"
msgstr "Dürfen wir mit Ihrem Werkzeug spielen, Ms. Wanda? Wir sind auch ganz vorsichtig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Would we change anything if we could go back in time?"
msgstr "Würden wir etwas ändern, wenn wir in der Zeit zurückreisen könnten?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "It's resting."
msgstr "Ruht sich aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS"
