msgstr "Sieht aus, als würde er gut brennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "JA! BRENNE!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, er würde immer noch brennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "One less tree in the world."
msgstr "Ein Baum weniger auf der Welt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Die in a fire!"
msgstr "Stirb' im Feuer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "Keeps the rain out your eyes and in someone else's."
msgstr "Hält dir den Regen aus den Augen und lässt ihn auf andere tropfen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "Well, looks aren't everything."
msgstr "Tja, Aussehen ist eben nicht alles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "What's your problem? Quit staring!"
msgstr "Was hast denn du für ein Problem? Hör auf zu starren!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "Ew ew ew!!"
msgstr "Igittigitt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "Squish it!!"
msgstr "Zermatschen!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "They spread like fire."
msgstr "Die breiten sich aus wie Flammen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "I wish it lit stuff on fire."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, es könnte Dinge in Brand setzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "It's no good until it's been placed."
msgstr "Nutzlos, solange ich ihn nicht irgendwo platziert habe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "It was a nice finale."
msgstr "Das war ein nettes Finale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sigh. It's a pile of dirt."
msgstr "Seufz. Das ist ein Haufen Dreck."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Hurry up, dirtpile. Feed me!"
msgstr "Beeil dich, Dreckhaufen. Füttere mich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "Stupid thing needs poop."
msgstr "Das dumme Ding braucht Kacke."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Farming is so much work..."
msgstr "Landwirtschaft ist so anstrengend ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "Heh heh."
msgstr "Hehe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Took long enough."
msgstr "Das hat ja lange genug gedauert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Well that looks kind of unnatural."
msgstr "Das sieht irgendwie widernatürlich aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Wait, what kind of vegetable is that supposed to be?"
msgstr "Moment, was für ein Gemüse soll das denn sein?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "A dumb plant."
msgstr "Eine blöde Pflanze."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "Grow faster already!"
msgstr "Nun wachs schon schneller!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "Yeah... I'm not eating that."
msgstr "Ja ... Nö. Das esse ich nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A big pile of stinky mush."
msgstr "Ein großer Haufen stinkender Pampe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "Ugh, this is going to take ages."
msgstr "Bäh, das wird ja ewig dauern."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "Yeah, fight that ground!"
msgstr "Jau, kämpf gegen den Boden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "Guess I better find a dumb spot to plant some dumb plants."
msgstr "Ich sollte wohl besser einen blöden Platz finden, um ein paar blöde Pflanzen zu pflanzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Get outta here!"
msgstr "Komm da raus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "I dunno... it could put out some fires..."
msgstr "Hmm ... Ich könnte ein paar Feuer löschen ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "A phoenix reborn!"
msgstr "Wie Phönix aus der Asche!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "So what does the feather do again?"
msgstr "Also was macht die Feder wieder?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Canary feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "Feder eines Kanarienvogels. Riecht wahrscheinlich schrecklich, wenn sie brennt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Black bird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "Schwarze Vogelfeder. Riecht im Feuer bestimmt schrecklich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Redbird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "Feder eines roten Vogels. Riecht wahrscheinlich schrecklich, wenn sie brennt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "Snowbird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "Feder eines Schneevogels. Riecht wahrscheinlich schrecklich, wenn sie brennt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She looks scared half to death."
msgstr "Sie sieht halb zu Tode erschreckt aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "I'm not painting that."
msgstr "Ich streich den aber nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "Dumb post."
msgstr "Dummer Pfosten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "Better not shock me!"
msgstr "Du schockst mich lieber nicht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "It's useless like that."
msgstr "So ist er nutzlos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "I guess we could pen stuff in with it."
msgstr "Wir könnte darin jemanden einsperren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "No point just leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "Bringt nichts, das einfach liegen zu lassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "No point just leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "Bringt nichts, das einfach liegen zu lassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "Not the prettiest fence in the world, but it works."
msgstr "Nicht der hübscheste Zaun der Welt, aber er tut seine Aufgabe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "I'm gonna go fight a fence!"
msgstr "Ich werde mit einem Zaun kämpfen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket full of nasty."
msgstr "Ein Eimer voll Ekelzeugs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "It's just so festive!"
msgstr "Er ist so festlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It needs more firecrackers before I'd call it \"festive\"."
msgstr "Es braucht mehr Böller, bevor man das \"festlich\" nennen kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "Looks like old people fruit."
msgstr "Sieht aus wie Obst für alte Leute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "I won't turn down a plate of pasta."
msgstr "Ich lehne einen Teller Pasta nicht ab!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "When I'm done with the food I can burn the stick!"
msgstr "Wenn ich mit dem Essen fertig bin, kann ich den Stock abfackeln!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "As usual, fire made it better."
msgstr "Wie immer, Feuer hat das verbessert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "So I just wave it and FIRE APPEARS?"
msgstr "Also schwinge ich es einfach und dann KOMMT FEUER?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Light'em up!"
msgstr "Zünd sie an!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish they didn't run away!"
msgstr "Ich wünschte, sie würden nicht davonlaufen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "They're like little fires in my pocket!"
msgstr "Sie sind wie kleine Feuer in meiner Tasche!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "I actually kind of like that one."
msgstr "Ich mag diese Dinger irgendwie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "What do you mean it's a weed? Looks like an improvement to me!"
msgstr "Was soll das heißen, es ist ein Unkraut? Sieht für mich wie eine Verbesserung aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm... So dry. So flammable."
msgstr "Mmh ... So trocken. So brennbar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "Hey, I'm feeling really inspired to write!"
msgstr "Hey, ich fühle mich richtig inspiriert, zu schreiben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Uh oh. It's almost gone!"
msgstr "Oh. Es ist schon fast aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could watch it for hours."
msgstr "Da könnt ich stundenlang zusehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "BURN! BURN FASTER!"
msgstr "BRENNE! BRENNE SCHNELLER!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "This fire is small and boring."
msgstr "Dieses Feuer ist klein und langweilig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Burn!"
msgstr "Brenne!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "Make the fire come back!"
msgstr "Hol das Feuer wieder zurück."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "That's my absolute favorite toy."
msgstr "Das ist mein absolutes Lieblingsspielzeug."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Almost out."
msgstr "Fast aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "And stay off!"
msgstr "Und bleib aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "I wish you'd shut your lid and stop putting out fires."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, du würdest deinen Deckel schließen und damit aufhören, die Feuer auszumachen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Slippery fishy!"
msgstr "Rutschiger Fisch!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "I love throwing things to catch other things!"
msgstr "Ich liebe es, Sachen auszuwerfen, um andere Sachen zu fangen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "Fishing for the answer with a hook, line and sinker."
msgstr "Zum Angeln von Antworten. Mit Schnur und Bleigewicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "Needs fire!"
msgstr "Braucht mehr Feuer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Less slippery now that it's found fire."
msgstr "Jetzt ist er nicht mehr so glitschig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "It's fishy, real fishy."
msgstr "Fischig. Wirklich fischig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "I like sushi, but I prefer it flame-broiled."
msgstr "Ich mag Sushi, aber am liebsten flambiert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "Fish and fire go well together."
msgstr "Fische und Feuer passen gut zusammen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "It's fishy, real fishy."
msgstr "Fischig. Wirklich fischig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "What you see is what you get. Sticks of fish."
msgstr "Was du siehst, ist was du bekommst. Fisch am Stiel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Convenient taco-grip."
msgstr "Praktisches Taco-Gerippe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "Did we just... put a hole in the boat?"
msgstr "Haben wir gerade ... ein Loch ins Boot gemacht?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Less slippery now that it's found fire."
msgstr "Jetzt ist er nicht mehr so glitschig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "The poor man's fire-starter."
msgstr "Der Anzünder des armen Mannes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Sigh."
msgstr "SEUFZ. NATUR IST SCHRECKLICH."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire is magic!"
msgstr "Feuer ist Magie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "I'd hate to share this."
msgstr "Die will ich mit niemandem teilen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "Oh good, I hate drowning."
msgstr "Oh, gut, ich hasse es zu ertrinken."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't have time to waste on flowers."
msgstr "Ich habe nicht die Zeit, um sie mit Blumen zu verschwenden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "I'd like to burn this flower in particular."
msgstr "Ich möchte ganz besonders diese Blume verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "A halo of flowers. Too bad it's not a burning halo of flowers."
msgstr "Ein Heiligenschein aus Blumen. Schade, dass es kein brennender Heiligenschein ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "I'd rather a bowl of flames."
msgstr "Mir wäre eine Schüssel voll Flammen lieber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "It's burning inside."
msgstr "Brennt im Inneren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "It's inner flame is dying."
msgstr "Ihre innere Flamme erlischt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "Ugh, that smells terrible."
msgstr "Pfui, das riecht schrecklich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "Looks like good kindling."
msgstr "Sieht aus wie guter Feueranzünder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Fuel for the fire."
msgstr "Kraftstoff für das Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
