#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT"
