#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
