#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
