msgstr "Der beste Freund des Menschen und des Roboters."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "He's planning something. I can tell."
msgstr "Er plant etwas. Soviel kann ich sagen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "You'll pay for your crimes, crow!"
msgstr "Du wirst für deine Verbrechen bezahlen, Krähe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "I think we're supposed to follow these."
msgstr "Ich glaube, wir sollen ihnen folgen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "I know a curse when I see it."
msgstr "Ich erkenne einen Fluch, wenn ich ihn sehe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "I think I might be allergic to this."
msgstr "Es könnte sein, dass ich dagegen allergisch bin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "Sorry, I might've taken a little bite."
msgstr "Entschuldigung, ich habe möglicherweise einen kleinen Bissen genommen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Yum! Tastes woody!"
msgstr "Mjam! Schmeckt holzig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Want to hear my loon call?"
msgstr "Willst du mal meinen Seetaucher-Ruf hören?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Part of the Canadian shield."
msgstr "Ein Teil des kanadischen Schilds."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Not even so much as a \"thank you\", eh?"
msgstr "Noch nicht einmal ein \"Danke\", was?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "Whatever he's got better not be contagious."
msgstr "Was auch immer er hat, ist hoffentlich nicht ansteckend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "Should we help him out, Luce?"
msgstr "Wollen wir ihm aushelfen, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey there, buddy. You don't look so bad."
msgstr "Hey, Kumpel. Siehst gar nicht so übel aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "No good deed goes unpunished."
msgstr "Keine gute Tat bleibt ungesühnt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "That's some firmly planted stone."
msgstr "Das ist ein wahrlich fest verankerter Stein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks sturdy... ish."
msgstr "Sieht robust aus ... ein bisschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "That doesn't smell quite right, eh."
msgstr "Das riecht nicht ganz richtig, was?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "Smells ripe."
msgstr "Riecht streng."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
