msgstr "Ich habe Ahnung von voller Ladung!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "Argh! No charge!"
msgstr "Argh! Keine Ladung!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "This minnow won't win, no!"
msgstr "Diese Pfrille wird nicht gewinnen, nein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "I'll have to produce some bigger produce, hyuyuyu!"
msgstr "Ich muss ein paar größere Produkte ... produzieren, hyuyuyu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I can't create from nothing."
msgstr "Ich kann nicht aus nichts erschaffen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Another soul has use of it right now."
msgstr "Ist bereits von einer anderen Seele in Gebrauch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "I've made an error."
msgstr "Ich habe einen Fehler gemacht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "Oh I simply couldn't."
msgstr "Oh, ich konnte es einfach nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "I'll come back around once the ground's settled down."
msgstr "Ich bin bereit dazu, sobald der Boden sich beruhigt hat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd rather snack on a soul no one's using."
msgstr "Ich würde lieber an einer Seele naschen, die nicht in Gebrauch ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "Mortals need physical food more than I do."
msgstr "Sterbliche brauchen mehr physische Nahrung als ich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I could hop over, I suppose."
msgstr "Ich könnte wohl rüberhüpfen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "Drat! That hat!"
msgstr "Große Wut, da ist ein Hut!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "Another soul is building it!"
msgstr "Eine andere Seele baut es!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "I felt it melt."
msgstr "Der Filz schmilzt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "Sigh, too high."
msgstr "Das ist doof und viel zu hoch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "Oh my, it's dry! Later, I'll try."
msgstr "Trocken wie ein Kuchen. Ich werde es später versuchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I'm afraid the pot is far too hot!"
msgstr "Ich fürchte, der Topf ist viel zu heiß!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Another soul has use of it right now."
msgstr "Ist bereits von einer anderen Seele in Gebrauch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "First it must be relieved of its possessions."
msgstr "Zuerst muss das von allen Besitztümern befreit werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Miss! Boo and hiss!"
msgstr "Daneben! Du kannst noch was erleben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "I have no imagination."
msgstr "Ich habe keine Fantasie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "I'd better abscond to a freshwater pond."
msgstr "Ich sollte lieber in einen Süßwasserteich flüchten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Stop, abort! My line's too short!"
msgstr "Halt, Stopp! Meine Schnur ist zu kurz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "Can't stand it! Left empty-handed!"
msgstr "So kann das doch nicht enden! Ich geh mit leeren Händen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "This soul's already been sucked! Hyuyu!"
msgstr "Diese Seele ist bereits ausgesaugt! O jemine!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "I will try again at a different point in time."
msgstr "Ich werde es später noch einmal versuchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "Its soul is prevented from returning here."
msgstr "Seine Seele wird daran gehindert, hierher zurückzukehren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "Let them have their fun, then I'll show the mortals how it's done."
msgstr "Sollen sie ihren Spaß haben, dann zeige ich den Sterblichen, wie man das macht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "Oh drat, it doesn't want that."
msgstr "Oh verflixt, das will es nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "Their soul's not in right now."
msgstr "Ihre Seele ist gerade nicht da."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We cannot learn what we already know!"
msgstr "Wir können nicht lernen, was wir bereits wissen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "There's already a dish, and it looks delish!"
msgstr "Es gibt bereits ein Gericht, und es sieht lecker aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "No, no, no."
msgstr "Nein, nein, nein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "There's no body for it to return to."
msgstr "Es gibt keinen Körper, zu dem sie zurückkehren kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "Its tummy rumbles for the soul of a log."
msgstr "Sein Magen rumort. Will wohl die Seele eines Holzscheits."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "There is only room... for a 'shroom!"
msgstr "Da gehört 'n Pilz hin!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "It doesn't want to put down roots here."
msgstr "Will hier keine Wurzeln schlagen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "It couldn't fit if it wanted to!"
msgstr "Das kann einfach nicht passen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "The light of the moon, I hope it comes soon!"
msgstr "Das Licht des Mondes, ich hoffe, es kommt bald!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "I speak in tongues, but not that one."
msgstr "Ich spreche in Zungen, aber nicht in dieser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "It would be in our best interest to not."
msgstr "Lieber nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "It couldn't fit if it wanted to!"
msgstr "Das kann einfach nicht passen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I do not think so, no no no!"
msgstr "Ich glaube nicht, nein, nein, nein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "That's quite wrong, yes, yes!"
msgstr "Das ist völlig falsch, ja, ja!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "Our souls are in mortal danger right now!"
msgstr "Unsere Seelen sind gerade in Lebensgefahr!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "This beautiful chaos inhibits me."
msgstr "Dieses schöne Chaos hemmt mich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "The night is upon us!"
msgstr "Die Nacht naht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
msgid "Her majesty's schedule must be bananas, hyuyu!"
msgstr "Der Zeitplan ihrer Majestät muss verrückt sein, hui!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Their mind inhabits another plane right now."
msgstr "Ihr Verstand bewohnt gerade eine andere Ebene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "It is full already."
msgstr "Schon voll."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT"
msgid "My pocket's too tight for that hat to sit right."
msgstr "Meine Tasche ist zu eng, der Hut passt nicht richtig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid "Now wait one minute, there's nothing in it!"
msgstr "Moment mal, da ist doch gar nichts drin!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "What a picky little prism!"
msgstr "Was für ein wählerisches kleines Prisma!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "Its color is wrong, wrong, wrong."
msgstr "Die Farbe ist falsch, falsch, falsch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "It looks downright silly, hyuyu!"
msgstr "Sieht albern aus. O jemine!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "First I must gain their focus."
msgstr "Erstmal heißt es konzentrieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "Their soul's not in right now."
msgstr "Ihre Seele ist gerade nicht da."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "Their brim is bursting!"
msgstr "Die sind völlig voll!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Their mind inhabits another plane right now."
msgstr "Ihr Verstand bewohnt gerade eine andere Ebene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "First I must gain their focus."
msgstr "Erstmal heißt es konzentrieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "Their soul's not in right now."
msgstr "Ihre Seele ist gerade nicht da."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "Their brim is bursting!"
msgstr "Die sind völlig voll!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Their mind inhabits another plane right now."
msgstr "Ihr Verstand bewohnt gerade eine andere Ebene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We cannot learn what we already know!"
msgstr "Wir können nicht lernen, was wir bereits wissen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER"
msgid "The tin gnat is not keen to chat."
msgstr "Die Blechschnake ist nicht sehr gesprächig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM"
msgid "I'm afraid it's true, this won't work on you."
msgstr "Tut mir leid, das steht nicht für dich bereit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY"
msgid "Fiddle dee dee, they won't listen to me!"
msgstr "Fiddle-di-du, sie hören mir nicht zu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED"
msgid "Surely secured!"
msgstr "Sicher gesichert!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD"
msgid "My furry friend is too caught up in their furious frenzy."
msgstr "Mein pelziger Freund ist in seiner Raserei gefangen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF"
msgid "First I must find a beefalo to be mine."
msgstr "Zuerst muss ich ein Beefalo finden, das mein sein soll."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER"
msgid "Now now my friend, I can't hitch you up while you're way over there!"
msgstr "Nun, mein Freund, ich kann dich nicht anpflocken, wenn du so weit drüben bist!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1"
msgid "What a fiendishly frustrating contraption! I'm impressed."
msgstr "Was für eine fies frustrierende Erfindung! Beeindruckend!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2"
msgid "Perhaps I should try a new tack! Hyuyu!"
msgstr "Vielleicht sollte ich es mal anders versuchen! Hui!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3"
msgid "My guise as a sailor was a spectacular failure!"
msgstr "Mein Auftritt als Seemann war ein spektakulärer Fehlschlag!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED"
msgid "Will a change of fate be in order?"
msgstr "Ist eine Schicksalswende angesagt?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT"
msgid "Why was I not invited to the festivities?"
msgstr "Warum wurde ich nicht zu den Feierlichkeiten eingeladen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE"
msgid "It has made a pact with another."
msgstr "Das hat schon einen Pakt mit einem anderen geschlossen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's had its forty winks, methinks."
msgstr "Er fängt eine Mütze voll Schlaf, denk ich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "Its focus is elsewhere."
msgstr "Geistesabwesend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR"
msgid "I fear I've brought the wrong gear, hyuyu!"
msgstr "Ich fürchte, ich habe die falsche Ausrüstung dabei, hui!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF"
msgid "Warly won't let me peek inside. He's no fun."
msgstr "Warly lässt mich nicht reingucken. Blöder Typ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC"
msgid "I don't think he knows how to use it."
msgstr "Ich glaube nicht, dass er weiß, wie man damit umgeht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE"
msgid "Rather annoyed with this void."
msgstr "Ich will so viel mehr, aber das Ding ist wieder leer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK"
msgid "Just my luck, it's stuck."
msgstr "Wieder mein Glück, rührt sich kein Stück."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES"
msgid "I've had enough of this monkey stuff."
msgstr "Ich hab genug von diesem Affenzeug."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE"
msgid "Another soul has use of it."
msgstr "Ist bereits von einer anderen Seele in Gebrauch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1"
msgid "What's the matter? I won't bite."
msgstr "Was ist los? Ich beiße nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2
