msgstr "Ooo, es hebt ab!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
