msgstr "Für dieses Lied möchte man sterben!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.record_hallowednights
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.record_hallowednights"
msgid "Soundtrack of the Night!"
msgstr "Soundtrack der Nacht!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reflectivevest_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reflectivevest_cawnival"
msgid "Stay cool and well-dressed in your Cawnival best."
msgstr "Bleib cool und sei der Bester in der Krähneval-Weste."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_alchemytable
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_alchemytable"
msgid "Everything a potion maker needs."
msgstr "Alles, was ein Trankmischer braucht."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_crystal"
msgid "Crystals have long been thought to hold transformative powers, perfect for alchemical experiments."
msgstr "Kristallen werden seit langem transformative Kräfte zugeschrieben, die sich perfekt für alchemistische Experimente eignen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_gothic"
msgid "A moody design for broody alchemists."
msgstr "Ein schwermütiges Design für grüblerische Alchemisten."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_pod"
msgid "This pod uses space-age printing technology to perform unspace-age alchemy. How stylish!"
msgstr "Hier wird mit modernster Technologie altmodischste Alchemie betrieben. Wie elegant!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_science
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_science"
msgid "Some might say that storing unstable chemicals next to a running engine is a \"bad idea\", but these people simply lack your vision."
msgstr "Manch einer mag sagen, dass das Lagern instabiler Chemikalien neben einem laufenden Motor eine \"schlechte Idee\" sei, aber diesen Leuten fehlt einfach eine Vision."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_science_resurrected
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab2_science_resurrected"
msgid "Some might say that storing unstable chemicals next to a running engine is a \"bad idea\", but these people simply lack your vision."
msgstr "Manch einer würde sagen, dass das Lagern instabiler Chemikalien neben einem laufenden Motor eine \"schlechte Idee\" sei, aber diesen Leuten fehlt einfach deine Vision."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_adventure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_adventure"
msgid "Enjoy practicing the dark arts, in style."
msgstr "Genieße es, die dunklen Künste mit Stil zu üben."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_ancient"
msgid "You have the most unnerving feeling that you're being watched."
msgstr "Du hast das nervtötende Gefühl, beobachtet zu werden."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_crystal"
msgid "Specially designed to conduct magical energy... and look very fancy."
msgstr "Speziell auf das Leiten magischer Energie ausgelegt ... und dabei so schick."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_monster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_monster"
msgid "This evil monstrosity will aid you in bringing horror to the world."
msgstr "Diese böse Monstrosität wird dir dabei helfen, Schrecken in die Welt zu bringen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.researchlab3_nature"
msgid "Something dark seems to have taken root..."
msgstr "Hier scheint etwas Dunkles zu wurzeln ..."

