#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_bouquet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_bouquet"
msgid "Begin your Valentine's Day decorating with a bouquet of fresh flowers."
msgstr "Beginne deine Dekoraiton für den Valentinstag mit einem Strauß frischer Blumen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_brush
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_brush"
msgid "Nothing like a fresh coat of spectral paint."
msgstr "Es geht nichts über einen frischen Anstrich mit Spektralfarben."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_toilet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_toilet"
msgid "No need to flush everything, just splash on a new look!"
msgstr "Kein Grund, alles wegzuspülen, einfach einen Spritzer für einen neuen Look draufmachen!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_wand
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reskin_tool_wand"
msgid "Put a wanderful twist on things."
msgstr "Bringe eine wandervolle Wendung in die Dinge."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstatue_barber
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstatue_barber"
msgid "You wouldn't be caught dead with uncoiffed hair!"
msgstr "Niemals im Leben würde man dich mit unfrisiertem Haar erwischen!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstatue_monster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstatue_monster"
msgid "Come ROARING back to life!"
msgstr "Erwache BRÜLLEND zum Leben!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstone_fantasy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstone_fantasy"
msgid "They say this crystal has restorative properties... it may even bring back the dead!"
msgstr "Sie behaupten, dieser Kristall habe heilende Eigenschaften … er könne sogar die Toten wieder lebendig machen!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstone_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.resurrectionstone_gothic"
msgid "All this fuss, just to return to your gloomy little life."
msgstr "All dieser Aufruhr nur um zu deinem bedrückenden kleinen Leben zurückzukehren."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid"
msgid "The slings and arrows of fate have taken their toll on this poor, afflicted heart."
msgstr "Das Schicksal hat diesem armen, geplagten Herzen den Rest gegeben."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2"
msgid "Alas, some daggers through the heart are more literal than others."
msgstr "Leider sind manche Dolche durchs Herz wörtlicher als andere."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2alt"
msgid "Alas, some daggers through the heart are more literal than others."
msgstr "Leider sind manche Dolche durchs Herz wörtlicher als andere."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_3"
msgid "A stake in your heart that actually heals the undead."
msgstr "Ein Pfahl ins Herz, der die Untoten zurückholt."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_3alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_3alt"
msgid "A stake in your heart that actually heals the undead."
msgstr "Ein Pfahl ins Herz, der die Untoten zurückholt."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_4"
msgid "A heart, ripped out and offered to another."
msgstr "Ein Herz, herausgerissen und jemandem geboten."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_4alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_4alt"
msgid "A heart, ripped out and offered to another."
msgstr "Ein Herz, herausgerissen und jemandem geboten."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_alt"
msgid "The slings and arrows of fate have taken their toll on this poor, afflicted heart."
msgstr "Das Schicksal hat diesem armen, geplagten Herzen den Rest gegeben."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_lifecrystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_lifecrystal"
msgid "A shimmering, life-giving crystal."
msgstr "Ein schimmernder, lebensspendender Kristall."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_cawnival"
msgid "Show off your winnings!"
msgstr "Prahle mit deinen Gewinnen!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_fantasy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_fantasy"
msgid "A table straight from a fairy tale."
msgstr "Ein Tisch direkt aus einem Märchen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_hallowed
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_hallowed"
msgid "Draped in a tablecloth of the finest spider silk."
msgstr "Mit einer Tischdecke aus feinster Spinnenseide drapiert."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_handmade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_handmade"
msgid "Gather 'round to share some hearty food and laughs."
msgstr "Sammelt euch hier, um herzlich zu speisen und zu lachen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_rose"
msgid "Not exactly a bed of roses, but it'll do."
msgstr "Nicht gerade ein Bett aus Rosen, aber es reicht aus."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.round_table_western"
msgid "A perfect table for cheating at cards, after a long day spent cheating death."
msgstr "Ein perfekter Tisch, um nach einem langen Tag, an dem man dem Tod um eine Seele betrog, beim Kartenspiel zu betrügen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_an"
msgid "Beauty can be found everywhere, even in blunt force."
msgstr "Schönheit kann überall gefunden werden – selbst bei roher Gewalt."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_arcane
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_arcane"
msgid "A weapon favored by forgotten warriors of old."
msgstr "Eine von den vergessenen Kriegern vergangener Zeiten bevorzugte Waffe."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_heavy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruins_bat_heavy"
msgid "Lacerate with a cursed blade."
msgstr "Verletzte mit einer verfluchten Klinge."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinshat_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinshat_an"
msgid "Give your head the royal treatment in this finely crafted crown."
msgstr "Verleihe deinem Kopf eine königliche Bedeckung mit dieser erlesenen Krone."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinshat_arcane
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinshat_arcane"
msgid "The ancient secrets it holds have been lost to time."
msgstr "Die uralten Geheimnisse sind im Lauf der Zeit verschollen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinsrelic_chair_tesla
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinsrelic_chair_tesla"
msgid "Coil up with a good book in this chair."
msgstr "Spule dich mit einem guten Buch auf diesem Stuhl ein."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinsrelic_chair_toilet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ruinsrelic_chair_toilet"
msgid "Loo, loo, skip to my loo!"
msgstr "Toiletto, Toiletti, alles paletti!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_western"
msgid "Drive your cattle in style."
msgstr "Reite auf deinem Rind mit Stil."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_yotb
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_yotb"
msgid "The best seat in the house for beefalo-related festivities."
msgstr "Der beste Platz im Haus für Festivitäten rund um Beefalos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_yotbalt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saddle_basic_yotbalt"
msgid "The best seat in the house for beefalo-related festivities."
msgstr "Der beste Platz im Haus für Festivitäten rund um Beefalos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_kitchen
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_kitchen"
msgid "A sweet design for salty storage."
msgstr "Ein süßes Design für ein salziges Lager."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_nautical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_nautical"
msgid "This shell encrusted container utilizes sea salt as a natural preservative."
msgstr "In diesem mit Muscheln übersäten Behälter wird Meersalz als natürliches Konservierungsmittel verwendet."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_shaker
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_shaker"
msgid "Why not shake things up a bit?"
msgstr "Nicht für Wunden."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.saltbox_victorian"
msgid "Stylish and practical food storage."
msgstr "Stilvolle und praktische Lebensmittelaufbewahrung."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sanityrock_fantasy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sanityrock_fantasy"
msgid "This mysterious pillar seems to grow and shrink, as if by magic."
msgstr "Diese mysteriöse Säule scheint auf magische Weise zu wachsen und zu schrumpfen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sanityrock_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sanityrock_gothic"
msgid "Was that pillar there before? Have you finally gone mad?"
msgstr "War die Säule schon vorher hier? Bist du nun vollends verrückt geworden?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sculptingtable_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sculptingtable_gothic"
msgid "Sculpt intricate stonework to your heart's content."
msgstr "Forme nach Herzenslust komplizierte Steinmetzarbeiten."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sculptingtable_swamp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sculptingtable_swamp"
msgid "A stone sculting swampy spin-off."
msgstr "Ein sumpfiger Ableger zum Skulptieren von Steinen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seafaring_prototyper_lighthouse
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seafaring_prototyper_lighthouse"
msgid "A beacon of nautical knowledge."
msgstr "Ein Leuchtturm nautischen Wissens."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seedpouch_garden
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seedpouch_garden"
msgid "A pretty purse for all your seed-carrying needs."
msgstr "Eine hübsche Tasche für all deine Samenbelange."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seedpouch_rustic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.seedpouch_rustic"
msgid "Sturdily hand-stitched for rambunctious gardeners."
msgstr "Robust von Hand genäht für unermüdliche Gärtner."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sewing_mannequin_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.sewing_mannequin_an"
msgid "A fashion idol."
msgstr "Ein Modeidol."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_feathered
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_feathered"
msgid "A shovel for the self-reliant adventurer."
msgstr "Eine Schaufel für den eigenverantwortlichen Abenteurer."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_heart
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_heart"
msgid "Just the thing to help bury those pesky feelings."
msgstr "Genau das Richtige, um diese nervigen Gefühle zu begraben."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_invisible
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_invisible"
msgid "Convey an incredibly convincing impression of a shovel."
msgstr "Vermittelt einen unglaublich überzeugenden Eindruck von einer Schaufel."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_northern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_northern"
msgid "A rustic, sturdy shovel."
msgstr "Rustikale, stabile Schaufel."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_rose"
msgid "For those tough rose to hoe."
msgstr "Für diejenigen Rosen, die schwer zu hacken sind."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_victorian"
msgid "A lovely shovel with decorative silver engravings."
msgstr "Eine schöne Schaufel mit dekorativen Silbergravuren."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.siestahut_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.siestahut_cawnival"
msgid "Between all those Cawnival games, a quick siesta might be just the ticket."
msgstr "Zwischen all den Krähneval-Spielen könnte eine kleine Siesta genau das Richtige sein."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.siestahut_mystical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.siestahut_mystical"
